<title>UK: London gold fixes $2.70 lower in quiet Europe AM.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes $2.70 lower in quiet Europe AM.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixes at $319.00 compared to $321.70 on Monday PM and $321.35 AM. Lower overnight on profit-taking, producer selling. Volumes light, tightly rangebound in early Europe.</p>
<p>SILVER - Down two cents at $4.27/$4.29 after weak Monday close.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Easier at $402.00/$405.00, down $3.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Softer at $170.00/$174.00. Russia's export agency confirms Japan exports.</p>
</text>
